notes.content:
[b]Changes:[/b]

[list]
[*]Default keys now take into account multiple keyboard layouts. You can still change them in-game;
[*]Fixed a bug where sometimes, on some controllers, D-Pad inputs would be interrupted;
[*]Reworked gamepad detection system. Previously, virtual gamepads could block physical ones.
[/list]

[b]Changes:[/b]

[list]
[*]Minor layout changes in some areas;
[*]Teleporting miniboss rebalanced;
[*]Small fixes.
[/list]

[b]Changes:[/b]

[list][*]Small hints replaced by a full Tutorial Mode;
[*]Fixed a bug where mini-boss scores would not count towards the total percentage;
[*]Difficulty modes renamed;
[*]More shield points for solo players on the easiest difficulty;
[*]Default controls changed to make it easier for new players (controls can still be redefined to previous settings);
[*]Early areas restructured to welcome new players;
[*]Enemy targets are now marked;
[*]Small tweaks on some weapons.
[/list]

[b]Changes:[/b]

[list][*]Added hints explaining some game mechanics;
[*]Added a fourth jump to RD-Aster. Better movement and easier to read;
[*]More HP for bosses on higher difficulties;
[*]Four new achievements;
[*]Some tweaks in some areas.
[/list]

[b]Changes:[/b]

[list][*]Charge time for RD-Aster's cannon reduced, cooldown increased;
[*]Invincibility time does not restart anymore when falling into a pit after destroying a boss;
[*]Added invincibility time after killing mini-bosses;
[*]Some minor adjustments.
[/list]
